§§ `Order 40 Rule 1 -- interpretation and mode of application`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Rule 1(1): "'Act' means the Corruption, Drug Trafficking and Other Serious Crimes (Confiscation of Benefits) Act, and any
-- reference to a section is, unless it is otherwise expressly provided, a reference to a section in the Act."
