    `o 40 r 5(1)(b)(ii) that the defendant has been officially informed under section 23(1) of the Criminal Procedure Code that the defendant may be prosecuted for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence` IS A `o 40 r 2(1) a statement may be required`
    `o 40 r 5(1)(b)(iii) that after investigations for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence have been commenced against the defendant, the defendant has died or cannot be found or is outside the jurisdiction` IS A `o 40 r 2(1) a statement may be required`
    `o 40 r 5(1)(c) full particulars of the realisable property in respect of which the order is sought, specifying the person or persons holding such property, as far as the deponent is able to provide` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 40 r 5(1)(d) an indication of when it is intended that they should be instituted` IS A BOOLEAN

