    IF `it is a condition relating to the indemnifying of third parties against expenses incurred in complying with the order` OR `it is an exception relating to living expenses and legal expenses of the defendant`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "conditions and exceptions, including" -- the list is not closed

