-- Rule 6(2), the end of the effect: "to have effect until a day which is to be fixed for the hearing with notice of the application."  The end is a point the text states in its own words:
-- on the day fixed the order still has effect under this paragraph, and after it the paragraph says no.  Whether the order was continued at the hearing is for the Court, not this paragraph.
