    IF     (contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(a)(i) that proceedings have been instituted against the defendant for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence), and that those proceedings have not been concluded` EQUALS `o 40 r 2(1) it is stated` OR contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(a)(i) that proceedings have been instituted against the defendant for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence), and that those proceedings have not been concluded` EQUALS `o 40 r 2(1) it is not applicable on these facts`)
       AND (contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(a)(ii) that the defendant has been officially informed under section 23(1) of the Criminal Procedure Code that the defendant may be prosecuted for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence)` EQUALS `o 40 r 2(1) it is stated` OR contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(a)(ii) that the defendant has been officially informed under section 23(1) of the Criminal Procedure Code that the defendant may be prosecuted for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence)` EQUALS `o 40 r 2(1) it is not applicable on these facts`)
       AND (contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(a)(iii) that after investigations for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence) have been commenced against the defendant, the defendant has died or cannot be found or is outside the jurisdiction` EQUALS `o 40 r 2(1) it is stated` OR contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(a)(iii) that after investigations for a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence) have been commenced against the defendant, the defendant has died or cannot be found or is outside the jurisdiction` EQUALS `o 40 r 2(1) it is not applicable on these facts`)
       AND contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(b)(i) that the defendant had used or intended to use an instrumentality (giving particulars of the instrumentality) for the commission of the offence mentioned in sub-paragraph (a)(i), (ii) or (iii), as the case may be`
       AND contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(b)(ii) that the instrumentality is not available for forfeiture`
       AND contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(b)(iii) the reason mentioned in section 29B(2)(a), (b) or (c) that the instrumentality is not available for forfeiture (giving particulars of that reason)`
       AND contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(b)(iv) the value of the instrumentality at the time the offence was committed`
       AND contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(c) full particulars of the realisable property in respect of which the order is sought, and the person or persons who (to the best of the deponent's knowledge) hold the property`
       AND (`proceedings have been instituted against the defendant` OR contents's `o 40 r 13(3)(d) an indication of when it is intended that they should be instituted`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a bare "must" (QB); O 40 r 13(3) does not say what follows when something required is missing


